                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i1">
                              <locus from="3ra" to="39vb"/>
                              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4071GadlaKiSh">Gadla Kiros</title>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/>    
                              <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> <hi rend="rubric">ንቀድም፡ በረ</hi>ድኤተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ 
                                 <hi rend="rubric">ንጽሕፍ፡ ገድለ፡ ቅዱስ፡</hi> ወብፁዕ፡ አባ፡ ኪሮስ፡ ጸሎቱ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ወነበረ፡ መንበረ፡ አቡሁ፡ 
                                 ዮናአን፡ ወገብረ፡ ምግባራተ፡ አቡሁ፡ ወኢያንተገ፡ እምኔሁ። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i2">
                              <locus from="40ra" to="40rb"/>
                              <title>Prayer to Jesus Christ and St Mary: Christ, you who are our Redeemer, you who they pierced with a spear on the cross... </title>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <incipit>ክርስቶስ፡ ቤዛዊነ፡ ዘረሀዙኪ፡ በረምኅ፡ በመልዕልተ፡ መስቀል፡ ወአውሐዝኪ፡ ለሕፅበተ፡ ኃጢአትነ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ሰላም፡</hi> ለኪ፡ አመለትሕ፡ ልሑያት፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i3">
                              <locus from="41ra" to="51va"/>
                                 <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2016Mestir">Mǝśṭira ṣǝgeyāt</title>
                              <textLang mainLang="am"/> 
                              <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ምሥጢረ፡ ጽጌያት። <hi rend="rubric">ሰላም፡ ለኪ፡ ማርያም፡</hi> ምልእተ፡ ጸጋ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/>
                                 የክርስቲያን፡ ጸሎ<hi rend="rubric">ት፡ የኤዎስጣቴዎስ፡</hi> ረድኤት፡ እናገ<hi rend="rubric">ራኁ፡ ጥቂት። ከም</hi>ሥጢረ፡ ጽጌያት፡ የተናገረ፡ ይኹን። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i4">
                              <locus from="51va" to="61va"/>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2252salota">Ṣalota ʿǝṭān</title>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i5">
                              <locus from="61va" to="2va"/>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5678CommemorationRoch">Commemorative note and hymn for St Roch (Roqo)</title>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i6">
                           <locus from="62vb" to="64vb"/>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7321InfantsSus">Baʾǝnta ʾasassǝlo dawe ʾǝm-ḥǝḍānāt</title>
                              <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ፈጣሪ፡ ሕያው፡ ነባ</hi>ቤ፡ ጽሎተ፡ ፩፡ ቅዱስ፡ ሱስንዮስ፡ በእንተ፡ አሰስሎ፡ 
                                 ደዌ፡ እምሕፃናት፡ እለ፡ ይጠብዉ፡ ጥበ፡ እምኵሉ፡ ደዌያት። ወይበቍዕ፡ ዓዲ፡ ለብእሲት፡ ዘኢየሐዩ፡ ላቲ፡ ደቂቅ፡ ትጽሐፍ፡ ወትስቅሎ፡ ላዕሌሃ፡ ወይበቍዕ፡ በረድኤተ፡
                              እግዚአብሔር፡ ልዑል፡ ወክቡር፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i7">
                              <locus from="64vb" to="65ra"/>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <title>A prayer for relief from pains in the loins (possibly legs). It contains an ʾasmāt-prayer against enemies.</title>
                              <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> አንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ ሐቌ፡ ሕማመ፡ ሐቌ፡ ሕማመ፡ ሐቌ፡፡ ኅድግ፡ ይቤለከ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ 
                                 ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ በቃለ፡ እግዚ እነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ አዶናይ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                              <quote xml:lang="gez">ሎፍሐም፡ መሐፍሎን፡ በሮብኤል፡ መሐፉድ፡ አስማተ፡ ሰሎሞን፡ በከመ፡ አሰርኮ፡ ለብርያል፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></quote>
                           </msItem>
                           <msItem xml:id="p2_i8">
                              <locus from="65rb" to="73vb"/>
                              <textLang mainLang="gez"/> 
                              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1956Mashaf">Maṣḥafa nuzāze</title>
                              <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ ምሥጢረ፡ ኑዛዜ፡ ኅቡአን፡ በመጽሐፍ፡ ዘተቀድሐ፡ እም፹ወ፩፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ወእም፯፡ ቃላት። ሥርዋ፡ ለኃጢአት፡ አፍቅሮ፡ ንዋይ፡ ወቂቲለ፡ ነፍስ፡ ገብርኩ፡ 
                                 ጸሊአ፡ ቢጽ፡ ወአምልኮ፡ ባዕድ፡ ገበርኩ። ዝሙት፡ ምስለ፡ ሐራስ፡ ወትክቶ፡ ገበርኩ። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                           </msItem>
                        </msContents>
             
